  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/6PkCWkC/xaeros-waystone-2.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/RjWCgrnBZz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1066142815043719208?color=7289da&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=7289da&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"272\" height=\"41\"></span></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xYmrwP9/description.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">🛈</span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>此模组不支持</strong></span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap-fair-play-edition/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Xaero的小地图（公平游戏版）</strong></a><br></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:36px\">🛈</span> 此模组是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones2waypoints\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones2Waypoints</a> 的继任者，当玩家激活传送石碑时，会在Xaero的世界地图和Xaero的小地图中创建一个<strong>路径点</strong>。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:36px\">🛈</span> 此模组需要在<strong>客户端和服务端</strong>同时安装。<br></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:36px\">🛈</span> <span style=\"color:#f00\">这不是分支版本<span style=\"color:#000\">，</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">因为之前的模组已停止更新，我们为Forge 1.19.2、1.19.3、1.19.4、1.20和1.20.1版本创建了一个新的模组。</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span><span><span><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/dcZcCdK/banner-5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"94\"><br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>模组作者</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🛈</span> shoqapik12: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fiverr.com%252fshoqapik12\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fiverr链接</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmmcreviews.com%252fall%252fmods%252fxaeros-minimap-world-map-waystones-compatibility-forge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://150012028.v2.pressablecdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/mmcreview_banner_long.png\" alt=\"我的世界模组评测\" width=\"625\" height=\"104\"></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.kinetichosting.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:837px\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1133727001254039604/1470852110114357412/image.png?ex=698ec786&amp;is=698d7606&amp;hm=7ea2cfa9fafc9329f96c2ccf0370b9439dbd5abe9098be57dc7218c0694a734e&amp;=&amp;format=webp&amp;quality=lossless\" alt=\"图片\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
